{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>VoiceWise 是一款完全在本機運作的語音辨識應用程式，支援即時語音轉錄、錄音轉錄、本機音訊檔案轉錄，以及自動語音翻譯，適合需要保護私隱、經常處理語音筆記或會議記錄的用戶。現正限時免費，原價 US $0.99，把握機會下載。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能與優勢</h2>\n<p>VoiceWise 完全離線運作，無需連接網路，所有資料不會上傳，確保絕對私隱安全。應用程式完全無廣告，一次購買即可永久使用，不限次數。支援 100 種語言辨識，準確率超過 90%，並提供即時語音翻譯、語音轉文字、語音備忘錄等功能，配合大型 AI 模型，滿足不同場景需求。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-246-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-247-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-248-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-249-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-250-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-251-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：VoiceWise</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T05:19:27.368409+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}